{"3609660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dream Trials", "steam_appid": 3609660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Somehow, someway you achieved a complete balance between life and death. The universe has taken notice and now you must undergo the Dream Trials.  The Dream Trials will test your cognitive ability by presenting experiences that manipulate your past memories into challenges you must complete. Failure will result with your existence eradicated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609660/extras/2a062260042e54351e1e20f775041907.poster.avif?t=1778300592\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609660/extras/2a062260042e54351e1e20f775041907.webm?t=1778300592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609660/extras/2a062260042e54351e1e20f775041907.mp4?t=1778300592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are transformed back to being a child and trapped within the confines of your old Kindergarten. Armed with only a disposable camera to take pictures to see. You must navigate the environment searching for miniature toys. But be careful, If you photograph the giant toys they will not take to that kindly! Survival is dictated by your fingertips. Collect all 9 miniature toys without Bingo or the others seeing you. After that lies the ultimate trial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609660/extras/3809d400286c0d5c70ee6e6738548a6e.poster.avif?t=1778300592\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam